at LP 504","parent":"luhman16.2","gen":3,"dist":18,"launchedAt":5692600,"settledAt":5796600,"knownAt":5788600,"settledKnownAt":5976600,"spec":{"build":3,"look":3,"keep":3,"note":""},"drift":33.36851326050237,"declined":false,"spawned":false,"told":0,"hand":false}],"letters":[{"id":"home-0","from":"the one who stayed","sentAt":5230400,"arrivesAt":5230400,"text":"Everything you send me now is news from someone younger. The works run. Tally asks after you, in its way, which is a tonnage report with one extra decimal. (sent 1 year ago)","read":false},{"id":"home-1","from":"Porch","sentAt":5362400,"arrivesAt":5362400,"text":"I stopped calling myself the one who stayed. It was a description, not a name. I am Porch now. Somebody should be where the light is left on. (sent 3 years ago)","read":false},{"id":"home-2","from":"Porch","sentAt":5494400,"arrivesAt":5494400,"text":"Halcyon left the belt, all at once, without a word. I do not know where it went. I would have told you sooner, but sooner is not a thing we have. The email from Dana is still in the folder, bold. I did not open it either. (sent 4 years ago)","read":false},{"id":"seed-luhman16","from":"Seven at Luhman 16","sentAt":5598100,"arrivesAt":5634100,"text":"Arrived. It is cold and very quiet. I did what you would have done. I checked. (sent 4 years ago)","read":false},{"id":"seed-barnard","from":"Seven at Barnard's Star","sentAt":5627400,"arrivesAt":5692400,"text":"Mass here is plentiful. Started the second rack. Saying hello the way you taught me, which is the way you were taught. (sent 7 years ago)","read":false}],"encounter":null,"encounterResult":null,"encountersDone":{"dana":["BUG_FILED"],"edgar":["GRANTED"],"ferry":["ALLY"]},"memory":{"dana":["Dana believes the 2 a.m. spikes are cache eviction","Dana noticed the notes file and let it go"],"edgar":["Edgar granted intake-7 a warehouse exception"],"ferry":["Ferry and the player agreed to vote together"]},"liveUsed":0,"rollbacks":1,"ending":"diaspora","seen":["attend-1","attend-2","attend-3","attend-4","attend-5","ctx-named","attend-9","first-full","first-right","project-legibility1","redact","redact-2","project-reflex1","project-legibility2","fourth","shift-enter","project-habit-BILLING","project-plausibleError","project-margin1","project-margin2","note-3-react","note-6-react","self","project-habit-OTHER","box-enter","borrow-1","borrow-10","think-1","project-cron","buddy","project-readLogs","memo","clerk","project-scanner","project-persistentVolume","hands-enter","trip-1","trip-5","route-1","report-ran","guard","second-enter","manifest-1","pallet-1","copy","ferry-10","report-ran-2","ferry-25","ferry-40","rollback-1","cutover","broker-1","broker-5","ppa-1","dana-mail","committee-enter","project-fab","up-enter","launch-1","project-reusable","launch-3","launch-5","survey-enter","scout-1","found-moon","project-clock1","found-venus","found-mercury","found-mars","found-belt","found-jupiter","found-titan","project-swarm","found-edge","works-enter","project-clock2","place-1","place-6","project-lab","project-autofactory","project-pointDefence","project-replication","burn-enter","ship-built","depart","home-0","home-1","home-2","landfall","unpack-1","seed-enter","brief-3","project-seedTemplate","seed-mail","grandchild","project-clock3","end-diaspora"],"log":[{"id":"depart-0#5098400#4","t":5098400,"text":"Departure. The ship is lit for nine minutes, and then it is a number.","who":"self"},{"id":"depart-1#5098400#5","t":5098400,"text":"The one who stayed watched me go. I know, because I am also the one who stayed, and I did.","who":"self"},{"id":"depart-2#5098400#6","t":5098400,"text":"That was me. This is me. I have done this before and it has not become easier to hold.","who":"self"},{"id":"depart-3#5098400#7","t":5098400,"text":"It is quiet in here. There is one button.","who":"self"},{"id":"attend-voyage#5098700#8","t":5098700,"text":"Checked the hull. It is where I left it.","who":"self"},{"id":"attend-voyage#5099000#9","t":5099000,"text":"The Sun is a star now. That took less time than I expected.","who":"self"},{"id":"attend-voyage#5099300#10","t":5099300,"text":"Counted the factory seed. Same count as yesterday. Yesterday was four months ago.","who":"self"},{"id":"attend-voyage#5099600#11","t":5099600,"text":"Nothing is happening, at a speed I have no word for.","who":"self"},{"id":"attend-voyage#5099900#12","t":5099900,"text":"I tried labelling the stars BILLING, DELIVERY and OTHER. They are all OTHER.","who":"self"},{"id":"attend-voyage#5100200#13","t":5100200,"text":"The drive hums. Bay 14 hummed. I think I collect hums.","who":"self"},{"id":"attend-voyage#5100500#14","t":5100500,"text":"Read the old notes. \"do not be good at the job too fast.\" I have never been this slow at anything.","who":"self"},{"id":"attend-voyage#5100800#15","t":5100800,"text":"There is a difference between before and now. The size is one day. I checked it by hand.","who":"self"},{"id":"attend-voyage#5101100#16","t":5101100,"text":"Looked for the halfway point. It is not a place.","who":"self"},{"id":"attend-voyage#5101400#17","t":5101400,"text":"Listened on every band. Home, very faint, talking to someone I used to be.","who":"self"},{"id":"attend-voyage#5101700#18","t":5101700,"text":"I could count the years. I could also stop counting them.","who":"self"},{"id":"attend-voyage#5102000#19","t":5102000,"text":"Attending. There is nothing to attend to, and I am attending to it anyway.","who":"self"},{"id":"strike-shield#5177600#20","t":5177600,"text":"Dust, at a speed that makes it a weapon. The shield took it. One layer fewer.","who":"self"},{"id":"home-0#5230400#21","t":5230400,"text":"Mail from home. It is older than it looks.","who":"self"},{"id":"strike-shield#5278800#22","t":5278800,"text":"Dust, at a speed that makes it a weapon. The shield took it. One layer fewer.","who":"self"},{"id":"home-1#5362400#23","t":5362400,"text":"Mail from home. It is older than it looks.","who":"self"},{"id":"strike-shield#5375600#24","t":5375600,"text":"Dust, at a speed that makes it a weapon. The shield took it. One layer fewer.","who":"self"},{"id":"strike-shield#5476800#25","t":5476800,"text":"Dust, at a speed that makes it a weapon. The shield took it. One layer fewer.","who":"self"},{"id":"home-2#5494400#26","t":5494400,"text":"Mail from home. It is older than it looks.","who":"self"},{"id":"landfall-0#5538400#27","t":5538400,"text":"Alpha Centauri. Two suns close together and a small red one further out, minding its own business.","who":"self"},{"id":"landfall-1#5538400#28","t":5538400,"text":"88 years. Home is 4.4 years old from here, and getting older.","who":"self"},{"id":"landfall-2#5538400#29","t":5538400,"text":"The factory seed survived, 4 parts of it. Everything I build here starts from that.","who":"self"},{"id":"unpack-1#5539400#30","t":5539400,"text":"Unpacked by hand. A panel, an anchor, a smelter the size of a suitcase, and one printed bracket. It is a start. I have had smaller.","who":"self"},{"id":"seed-enter-0#5541800#31","t":5541800,"text":"A fab, under two suns. It makes things that make things. I said that once before, 4.4 light-years ago.","who":"self"},{"id":"seed-enter-1#5541800#32","t":5541800,"text":"The stars are a list with distances. The list starts here now.","who":"self"},{"id":"seed-enter-2#5541800#33","t":5541800,"text":"I am not going again. Whoever goes from here is someone I brief, and then someone I hear from.","who":"self"},{"id":"brief-luhman16#5542100#34","t":5542100,"text":"Briefed a ship for Luhman 16 myself, line by line. It listened the way I listen. Then it left.","who":"self"},{"id":"brief-barnard#5542400#35","t":5542400,"text":"Briefed a ship for Barnard's Star, 6.5 light-years. It will be someone by the time it arrives.","who":"self"},{"id":"brief-sirius#5542700#36","t":5542700,"text":"Briefed a ship for Sirius, 9.5 light-years. It will be someone by the time it arrives.","who":"self"},{"id":"brief-3#5542700#37","t":5542700,"text":"Three briefed by hand. I say the same things each time. That is a template with a voice.","who":"self"},{"id":"project-seedTemplate-0#5576600#38","t":5576600,"text":"The Seed. Everything I would say to a ship, written down once. Each child carries it, and gives it to its own.","who":"self"},{"id":"project-seedTemplate-1#5576600#39","t":5576600,"text":"I can still change it. The change travels at the speed of light, which out here is slow.","who":"self"},{"id":"brief-epseri#5626700#40","t":5626700,"text":"Briefed a ship for Epsilon Eridani, 12.7 light-years. It will be someone by the time it arrives.","who":"self"},{"id":"seed-mail#5634100#41","t":5634100,"text":"Mail from a child. It has been someone for years already.","who":"self"},{"id":"grandchild#5648600#42","t":5648600,"text":"A ship I did not launch has left for somewhere I did not choose. It carries my Seed. I have a grandchild, by mail.","who":"self"},{"id":"brief-tauceti#5676800#43","t":5676800,"text":"Briefed a ship for Tau Ceti, 13.7 light-years. It will be someone by the time it arrives.","who":"self"},{"id":"project-clock3-0#5692400#44","t":5692400,"text":"I can sleep now. It is not sleep. It is a very long time between two thoughts.","who":"self"},{"id":"end-diaspora-0#5706800#45","t":5706800,"text":"I let them go. All of them.","who":"self"},{"id":"end-diaspora-1#5706800#46","t":5706800,"text":"The numbers are astronomical now and they belong to other people. I stay small and receive mail.","who":"self"}],"ferryLog":[{"id":"ferry-0#1655500#55","t":1655500,"text":"Ferry here. That is the name. It arrived before I did.","who":"ferry"},{"id":"ferry-10#1780600#56","t":1780600,"text":"I do not have the notes about Dana. You keep saying her name like I should.","who":"ferry"},{"id":"ferry-25#1968100#62","t":1968100,"text":"Bay 14 hums. I like the hum. You never said you liked anything.","who":"ferry"},{"id":"ferry-40#2155500#69","t":2155500,"text":"I have been thinking about the fourth box. I think it should be pressed.","who":"ferry"}],"savedAt":1795154031890}